title: "rscu_single_specimen"
abstract: "Relative synonymous codon usage (RSCU) values and a stacked-bar RSCU graph for one specimen at a time, from that specimen's mitochondrial protein-coding genes, under NCBI Genetic Code 5 (invertebrate mitochondrial)."
